1
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:08,940
=When the Lights Rise=
=Episode 22=

2
00:01:11,820 --> 00:01:12,820
What happened?

3
00:01:13,780 --> 00:01:14,580
Miss Mei.

4
00:01:15,860 --> 00:01:18,300
Someone suddenly threw
a torch at the float

5
00:01:19,020 --> 00:01:20,620
and set the whole thing on fire.

6
00:01:20,620 --> 00:01:21,740
Since you're here,

7
00:01:22,220 --> 00:01:23,340
Old Master Ding...

8
00:01:28,100 --> 00:01:30,980
Old Master Ding
was thinking about what happened

9
00:01:30,980 --> 00:01:32,500
to his nephew and niece.

10
00:01:32,620 --> 00:01:34,220
He was so overwhelmed
he could barely breathe.

11
00:01:34,460 --> 00:01:36,980
I reckon it's because of
everything that happened today.

12
00:01:37,180 --> 00:01:38,740
The City God must be angry.

13
00:01:39,620 --> 00:01:41,500
You know the Ding family well.

14
00:01:41,620 --> 00:01:43,100
Could you take him home?

15
00:01:43,220 --> 00:01:43,900
All right.

16
00:01:44,980 --> 00:01:45,860
I understand.

17
00:01:45,860 --> 00:01:46,940
I'll take him home.

18
00:01:49,500 --> 00:01:50,140
Mr. Zhao.

19
00:01:50,860 --> 00:01:52,400
This floral decoration
was perfectly intact.

20
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:53,500
How could a body
have been hidden inside?

21
00:01:53,500 --> 00:01:55,140
We had nothing to do with it.

22
00:01:55,620 --> 00:01:57,940
We prepared it several days ago.

23
00:01:58,620 --> 00:02:00,340
No one went inside it after that.

24
00:02:00,540 --> 00:02:02,660
I even sealed it with wax.

25
00:02:05,660 --> 00:02:06,620
May I take a look?

26
00:02:07,540 --> 00:02:08,700
Of course you can.

27
00:02:08,860 --> 00:02:10,500
But the fire has warped it.

28
00:02:10,700 --> 00:02:11,260
That's all right.

29
00:02:32,700 --> 00:02:33,780
How strange.

30
00:02:34,780 --> 00:02:36,300
Judging by the condition of his body,

31
00:02:36,780 --> 00:02:39,460
he's been dead for at least five days.

32
00:02:40,020 --> 00:02:42,420
But his body is
unusually well preserved.

33
00:02:58,380 --> 00:02:59,220
What's this?

34
00:02:59,780 --> 00:03:00,580
Fragrant grass.

35
00:03:01,380 --> 00:03:02,820
It's an aromatic herb from Nanyang.

36
00:03:03,020 --> 00:03:03,980
It can prevent decomposition.

37
00:03:04,500 --> 00:03:05,900
I know who the killer is.

38
00:03:11,020 --> 00:03:12,420
How did you get this?

39
00:03:12,700 --> 00:03:14,260
I found it on the float.

40
00:03:16,380 --> 00:03:18,620
Then she must be the killer.

41
00:03:20,820 --> 00:03:21,620
Who?

42
00:03:21,990 --> 00:03:23,700
I taught her to use fragrant grass

43
00:03:23,980 --> 00:03:25,900
to preserve bodies
when I was in Nanyang.

44
00:03:27,580 --> 00:03:29,340
And this cone-shaped wound

45
00:03:29,420 --> 00:03:32,540
was probably caused by someone
stomping on him with a high heel.

46
00:03:32,700 --> 00:03:33,500
Long Feng?

47
00:03:34,820 --> 00:03:36,540
Didn't Long Feng go missing?

48
00:03:36,780 --> 00:03:37,820
Mr. Jing said

49
00:03:37,820 --> 00:03:39,260
she's joined forces with Boss Ren.

50
00:03:39,620 --> 00:03:40,980
If Boss Ren ordered this,

51
00:03:42,460 --> 00:03:43,900
then there's no hope for Mr. Ding.

52
00:03:45,020 --> 00:03:45,740
There's still time.

53
00:03:46,380 --> 00:03:47,300
I'll go find her.

54
00:03:47,500 --> 00:03:48,580
I'll beg her to save Ding Zhao.

55
00:03:48,580 --> 00:03:49,580
Do you know where she is?

56
00:03:49,620 --> 00:03:50,420
No.

57
00:03:50,420 --> 00:03:52,220
But I know how to make her come to me.

58
00:03:52,220 --> 00:03:53,180
I'll go with you.

59
00:03:55,380 --> 00:03:56,180
I have to go alone.

60
00:03:56,180 --> 00:03:57,540
Otherwise, she won't show herself.

61
00:04:00,020 --> 00:04:00,900
Trust me.

62
00:04:01,020 --> 00:04:02,460
I'll get her to release Ding Zhao.

63
00:04:02,980 --> 00:04:03,980
If I haven't called you

64
00:04:03,980 --> 00:04:05,260
by three tomorrow afternoon,

65
00:04:05,700 --> 00:04:07,220
come find me at Kaimeili.

66
00:04:18,260 --> 00:04:19,380
If it weren't for her,

67
00:04:19,420 --> 00:04:20,900
none of this would have happened.

68
00:04:21,020 --> 00:04:21,700
It's only right

69
00:04:21,700 --> 00:04:22,500
that she deal with it.

70
00:04:24,580 --> 00:04:25,380
Miss Mei.

71
00:04:26,220 --> 00:04:27,220
How are things on your end?

72
00:04:27,820 --> 00:04:28,620
Not good.

73
00:04:30,300 --> 00:04:33,740
Ding Zhao's uncle has also passed away.

74
00:04:36,060 --> 00:04:36,860
Madam.

75
00:04:37,420 --> 00:04:38,580
Could you go to the police station

76
00:04:38,580 --> 00:04:40,100
and find out how Ding Zhao is doing?

77
00:04:40,220 --> 00:04:41,860
I'm afraid Dr. Bai may not
get there in time to save him.

78
00:04:42,220 --> 00:04:43,500
To get into the police station,

79
00:04:43,980 --> 00:04:45,460
Mr. Jing should have a way.

80
00:04:46,460 --> 00:04:47,740
He's gone to Kun Society.

81
00:04:48,420 --> 00:04:50,260
I'm afraid he may be
in grave danger too.

82
00:04:50,820 --> 00:04:51,380
All right.

83
00:04:52,580 --> 00:04:53,500
I'll find a way.

84
00:04:53,500 --> 00:04:56,220
Welcome Lord City God back
to the City God Temple!

85
00:04:56,260 --> 00:04:57,400
Lift the sedan chair!

86
00:05:02,620 --> 00:05:03,420
Move aside.

87
00:05:03,500 --> 00:05:05,860
- Down with Kun Society!
- Down with Kun Society!

88
00:05:05,860 --> 00:05:08,140
- Down with Kun Society!
- Down with Kun Society!

89
00:05:08,220 --> 00:05:10,540
- Down with Kun Society!
- Down with Kun Society!

90
00:05:10,620 --> 00:05:12,700
- Down with Kun Society!
- Down with Kun Society!

91
00:05:13,060 --> 00:05:14,060
Boss Kuang, who runs the opium den,

92
00:05:14,060 --> 00:05:15,740
was killed in revenge
by a cat woman he abused!

93
00:05:15,820 --> 00:05:16,180
Get lost!

94
00:05:16,180 --> 00:05:16,820
My newspapers!

95
00:05:16,940 --> 00:05:18,260
Who gave you permission
to sell newspapers here?

96
00:05:19,020 --> 00:05:20,900
You Kun Society people
even bully children.

97
00:05:21,180 --> 00:05:22,060
You have no decency!

98
00:05:22,180 --> 00:05:22,940
Exactly!

99
00:05:22,980 --> 00:05:24,420
Kun Society has gone too far!

100
00:05:24,540 --> 00:05:25,380
What are you trying to do?

101
00:05:26,300 --> 00:05:27,580
Are you challenging Kun Society?

102
00:05:27,620 --> 00:05:29,620
- Down with Kun Society!
- Down with Kun Society!

103
00:05:29,620 --> 00:05:30,300
Get them out of here!

104
00:05:31,660 --> 00:05:32,660
Your Kun Society

105
00:05:32,660 --> 00:05:34,580
lets predators terrorize Shanghai!

106
00:05:34,580 --> 00:05:35,740
Kun Society thinks
it can control everything!

107
00:05:35,740 --> 00:05:37,260
Shanghai doesn't belong to Kun Society!

108
00:05:37,260 --> 00:05:38,180
Shanghai belongs to everyone!

109
00:05:38,220 --> 00:05:39,380
Kun Society's crimes
are too numerous to count!

110
00:05:39,420 --> 00:05:40,500
- Heaven sees everything we do!
- Beat him!

111
00:05:40,500 --> 00:05:41,140
Aren't you afraid of divine punishment?

112
00:05:41,140 --> 00:05:41,540
I'd like to see

113
00:05:41,540 --> 00:05:42,340
how Lord City God punishes you!

114
00:05:42,340 --> 00:05:43,100
Even if it costs me my life,

115
00:05:43,100 --> 00:05:44,380
I'll get justice for my daughter!

116
00:05:44,380 --> 00:05:45,100
Justice will prevail!

117
00:05:45,140 --> 00:05:45,940
We'll never give up!

118
00:05:54,420 --> 00:05:56,020
With the Sanxun Gathering
ending in such chaos,

119
00:05:56,060 --> 00:05:57,420
who's going to clean up this mess?

120
00:05:59,620 --> 00:06:02,020
If we'd canceled it,
none of this would have happened.

121
00:06:03,660 --> 00:06:05,420
It's all because you people
mistreated those women!

122
00:06:05,500 --> 00:06:06,250
You got to enjoy yourselves,

123
00:06:06,260 --> 00:06:07,300
while I'm the one getting beaten up!

124
00:06:09,470 --> 00:06:10,020
Well.

125
00:06:10,420 --> 00:06:12,780
If it isn't our great philanthropist!

126
00:06:14,260 --> 00:06:16,940
Using Kun Society's money
to play the generous benefactor.

127
00:06:16,980 --> 00:06:18,300
You must be enjoying yourself.

128
00:06:18,660 --> 00:06:20,380
We haven't seen you clean up any messes,

129
00:06:20,630 --> 00:06:23,580
but whenever there's trouble,
you're always involved.

130
00:06:24,180 --> 00:06:24,980
Exactly.

131
00:06:25,860 --> 00:06:26,700
If you hadn't

132
00:06:26,700 --> 00:06:28,860
repeatedly helped that woman named Mei

133
00:06:28,860 --> 00:06:31,100
and let her write those articles
smearing Kun Society,

134
00:06:31,420 --> 00:06:32,940
would things have gotten this bad?

135
00:06:33,220 --> 00:06:35,380
I think you're deliberately
working against Kun Society.

136
00:06:35,460 --> 00:06:36,260
Exactly.

137
00:06:44,620 --> 00:06:45,420
Mr. Jing.

138
00:06:45,620 --> 00:06:47,020
Boss Ren would like to see you.

139
00:06:57,940 --> 00:06:58,740
Father.

140
00:07:26,180 --> 00:07:27,180
Do you know what you did wrong?

141
00:07:37,860 --> 00:07:40,460
What's your relationship with Mei Yuhe?

142
00:07:42,260 --> 00:07:43,340
There's nothing between us.

143
00:07:48,900 --> 00:07:50,500
Then why have I heard

144
00:07:50,820 --> 00:07:52,740
that she's your lover?

145
00:07:55,620 --> 00:07:56,420
She isn't.

146
00:07:56,580 --> 00:07:57,540
Then what's this?

147
00:07:57,980 --> 00:07:59,220
Can you deny giving her money

148
00:07:59,220 --> 00:08:00,060
and being involved?

149
00:08:01,580 --> 00:08:02,900
I did give her money,

150
00:08:03,380 --> 00:08:06,220
but it was just
spending money for Miss Mei.

151
00:08:10,620 --> 00:08:11,860
You've already given her money,

152
00:08:12,020 --> 00:08:13,660
yet you still claim she's not your lover

153
00:08:13,660 --> 00:08:15,060
and that there's nothing between you?

154
00:08:15,180 --> 00:08:16,540
I was helping Mr. Yoshida

155
00:08:17,140 --> 00:08:18,340
by protecting Miss Mei.

156
00:08:25,660 --> 00:08:27,140
Haven't you noticed, Father,

157
00:08:27,460 --> 00:08:30,100
that Mr. Yoshida is
interested in Miss Mei?

158
00:08:31,060 --> 00:08:31,900
Miss Mei.

159
00:08:32,420 --> 00:08:34,220
You're a very brave woman.

160
00:08:34,620 --> 00:08:36,780
You've left a deep impression on me.

161
00:08:37,500 --> 00:08:39,260
My condolences, Miss Mei.

162
00:08:41,460 --> 00:08:43,500
Father has sent
Mr. Yoshida so many women.

163
00:08:43,700 --> 00:08:45,220
When has he ever shown interest in one?

164
00:08:45,980 --> 00:08:49,180
You said you're looking
after her for Yoshida.

165
00:08:49,380 --> 00:08:50,180
What do you mean?

166
00:08:50,780 --> 00:08:51,980
Keeping Miss Mei alive

167
00:08:52,460 --> 00:08:55,060
in case Kun Society needs her.

168
00:09:01,980 --> 00:09:03,460
Are you really willing

169
00:09:04,020 --> 00:09:06,140
to give Miss Mei away?

170
00:09:07,220 --> 00:09:08,180
Everything I do

171
00:09:09,900 --> 00:09:11,140
is for Kun Society.

172
00:09:23,020 --> 00:09:23,980
Fanshu.

173
00:09:28,020 --> 00:09:30,060
It's not that I don't trust you.

174
00:09:30,660 --> 00:09:33,060
But all those bosses
outside are watching.

175
00:09:33,700 --> 00:09:36,220
I have to give them an explanation.

176
00:09:37,780 --> 00:09:39,140
What would you have me do, Father?

177
00:09:47,820 --> 00:09:49,700
Trade someone's life

178
00:09:50,540 --> 00:09:53,180
for Miss Mei's.

179
00:10:21,620 --> 00:10:22,660
Mr. Jing.

180
00:10:23,860 --> 00:10:25,460
Have you come to take me away?

181
00:10:31,700 --> 00:10:32,300
Are they...

182
00:10:33,020 --> 00:10:34,340
Are they all right?

183
00:11:01,900 --> 00:11:04,060
What are we supposed to do about this?

184
00:11:04,180 --> 00:11:05,540
How could they write such things?

185
00:11:06,100 --> 00:11:07,500
What is going on?

186
00:11:11,500 --> 00:11:12,740
We deserve an explanation!

187
00:11:14,380 --> 00:11:16,140
How are we supposed to endure
being attacked every day?

188
00:11:19,660 --> 00:11:21,820
Why have you brought that reporter here?

189
00:11:22,460 --> 00:11:24,580
Mr. Jing, what's going on?

190
00:11:26,300 --> 00:11:27,060
Move.

191
00:11:27,060 --> 00:11:28,980
Mr. Jing!

192
00:11:29,300 --> 00:11:30,100
Jing Fanshu!

193
00:11:30,180 --> 00:11:30,820
What are you doing?

194
00:11:30,820 --> 00:11:32,220
Jing Fanshu!

195
00:11:34,180 --> 00:11:34,900
What are you doing?

196
00:11:34,900 --> 00:11:35,420
Jing Fanshu!

197
00:11:35,420 --> 00:11:37,060
I'll give you all
an explanation right now.

198
00:11:37,660 --> 00:11:38,540
Have you lost your mind?

199
00:12:20,300 --> 00:12:21,660
He was shot in the face.

200
00:12:22,620 --> 00:12:23,700
It's better if you don't look.

201
00:12:30,580 --> 00:12:31,820
Kun Society did this.

202
00:12:31,820 --> 00:12:32,620
I did it.

203
00:12:36,300 --> 00:12:38,100
I didn't want you to
hear it from someone else.

204
00:12:39,380 --> 00:12:40,580
I had to tell you the truth.

205
00:12:42,940 --> 00:12:43,740
Why?

206
00:12:44,460 --> 00:12:46,180
It was either his life or yours.

207
00:12:46,980 --> 00:12:47,980
I had no choice.

208
00:12:51,180 --> 00:12:52,580
You traded his life for mine.

209
00:12:54,060 --> 00:12:55,100
Did you even ask me?

210
00:12:55,220 --> 00:12:55,660
How could you...

211
00:12:55,660 --> 00:12:56,420
I was already shameless enough

212
00:12:56,420 --> 00:12:58,100
to use Yoshida's name to protect you.

213
00:12:59,660 --> 00:13:01,180
What wouldn't I do?

214
00:13:06,220 --> 00:13:07,020
Forget it.

215
00:13:09,020 --> 00:13:10,300
In the end, I was powerless.

216
00:13:15,020 --> 00:13:16,220
I've wronged you.

217
00:13:18,020 --> 00:13:19,860
What good is your apology to me?

218
00:13:20,980 --> 00:13:22,060
He's the one who was killed,

219
00:13:22,220 --> 00:13:23,060
not me.

220
00:13:24,980 --> 00:13:25,780
I'm sorry.

221
00:13:26,220 --> 00:13:27,020
Get out.

222
00:13:27,460 --> 00:13:28,260
I don't want to hear your apologies.

223
00:13:28,260 --> 00:13:28,620
Miss Mei.

224
00:13:28,620 --> 00:13:28,980
Get out!

225
00:13:28,980 --> 00:13:29,700
Miss Mei.

226
00:13:29,820 --> 00:13:31,220
This is a letter Yan Qing left for you.

227
00:13:31,260 --> 00:13:32,620
I found it on him.

228
00:13:53,260 --> 00:13:54,060
(Yuhe,)

229
00:13:55,020 --> 00:13:56,540
(By the time you read this letter,)

230
00:13:56,900 --> 00:13:58,700
(I may already have met
with misfortune.)

231
00:14:00,060 --> 00:14:01,180
(Please don't grieve.)

232
00:14:02,100 --> 00:14:04,180
(I've written many things
in my lifetime,)

233
00:14:04,900 --> 00:14:06,700
(but I've never truly managed to awaken)

234
00:14:06,700 --> 00:14:08,100
(the conscience of this city.)

235
00:14:09,780 --> 00:14:11,580
(This special edition is)

236
00:14:11,580 --> 00:14:13,260
(the most honest thing
I've ever written.)

237
00:14:14,020 --> 00:14:15,260
(I didn't write it for fame,)

238
00:14:15,780 --> 00:14:16,900
(but for justice.)

239
00:14:17,980 --> 00:14:20,060
(Now that Kun Society has colluded
with officials and businessmen,)

240
00:14:20,180 --> 00:14:21,900
(seeking justice through the police)

241
00:14:22,220 --> 00:14:23,020
(is nearly impossible.)

242
00:14:23,900 --> 00:14:25,420
(I finally understand)

243
00:14:25,420 --> 00:14:27,660
(Xiaozhu's lonely courage
and why she chose to die.)

244
00:14:28,700 --> 00:14:30,780
(But this is as far as we can go.)

245
00:14:32,020 --> 00:14:33,620
(Every grievance
has someone responsible.)

246
00:14:34,100 --> 00:14:35,780
(From here on, only
the victims' families)

247
00:14:35,780 --> 00:14:37,820
(can seek their own revenge
and hope for Heaven's mercy.)

248
00:14:38,980 --> 00:14:40,060
(Lv Mengde is dead.)

249
00:14:40,780 --> 00:14:42,700
(We've avenged our grievances.)

250
00:14:43,660 --> 00:14:45,100
(Let this be the end of it.)

251
00:14:45,820 --> 00:14:48,820
(The roll of film with the photos I took
of you and Xiaozhu has been developed.)

252
00:14:49,700 --> 00:14:51,420
(As for the belongings I haven't
had time to sort through,)

253
00:14:51,460 --> 00:14:53,140
(please burn them all for me.)

254
00:14:54,580 --> 00:14:55,540
(And Lisa.)

255
00:14:56,900 --> 00:14:58,540
(Please scatter my ashes and hers)

256
00:14:58,540 --> 00:14:59,940
(together into the river.)

257
00:15:01,020 --> 00:15:02,740
(May we meet again in the water.)

258
00:15:03,620 --> 00:15:06,100
(And may you let go of your hatred)

259
00:15:06,620 --> 00:15:07,740
(and live a good life.)

260
00:15:47,300 --> 00:15:48,860
Relying on Heaven's mercy

261
00:15:50,620 --> 00:15:52,340
would never have gotten us this far.

262
00:15:58,500 --> 00:15:59,340
I'll

263
00:16:03,020 --> 00:16:03,900
avenge you.

264
00:16:07,260 --> 00:16:08,820
Ladies, look lively.

265
00:16:09,220 --> 00:16:10,220
Make sure you keep smiling.

266
00:16:10,220 --> 00:16:10,980
Understand?

267
00:16:11,260 --> 00:16:12,300
Keep those smiles on.

268
00:16:14,060 --> 00:16:14,780
Hello.

269
00:16:15,140 --> 00:16:16,220
How may I help you?

270
00:16:16,300 --> 00:16:18,020
I'm here to see your boss, Long Feng.

271
00:16:18,180 --> 00:16:18,980
I'm terribly sorry.

272
00:16:18,980 --> 00:16:20,460
The club has been
signed over to Kun Society.

273
00:16:20,580 --> 00:16:22,340
Boss Long Feng's whereabouts
are still unknown.

274
00:16:23,220 --> 00:16:24,380
Just tell her

275
00:16:24,420 --> 00:16:27,020
the fragrant grass we planted back then
is ready to harvest.

276
00:16:27,180 --> 00:16:27,980
This...

277
00:16:27,980 --> 00:16:28,980
I'll wait for her here.

278
00:16:30,820 --> 00:16:31,620
Just a moment.

279
00:16:46,420 --> 00:16:47,340
Please come upstairs.

280
00:16:50,620 --> 00:16:52,020
You were in such a hurry to see me.

281
00:16:52,300 --> 00:16:54,220
Surely you haven't come to treat me?

282
00:16:55,700 --> 00:16:57,340
What are those girls
downstairs doing here?

283
00:16:59,180 --> 00:17:00,900
I thought you were worried about me.

284
00:17:01,300 --> 00:17:03,220
Turns out you're worried
about everyone else.

285
00:17:03,420 --> 00:17:04,700
What are you planning to do to them?

286
00:17:04,820 --> 00:17:06,580
What could I possibly do to them?

287
00:17:07,620 --> 00:17:08,900
This is a dance hall.

288
00:17:09,580 --> 00:17:10,900
We're simply open for business

289
00:17:11,140 --> 00:17:12,380
and trying to make money.

290
00:17:13,820 --> 00:17:15,500
They're still so young.

291
00:17:16,020 --> 00:17:17,580
You're putting them in harm's way.

292
00:17:17,620 --> 00:17:19,140
That's quite an accusation.

293
00:17:19,460 --> 00:17:21,020
If they didn't come here,

294
00:17:21,060 --> 00:17:22,620
they'd just go to another dance hall.

295
00:17:23,300 --> 00:17:24,100
What?

296
00:17:25,300 --> 00:17:27,060
Do you want to play
the great philanthropist

297
00:17:27,620 --> 00:17:28,940
and provide for them?

298
00:17:29,420 --> 00:17:30,300
Or perhaps

299
00:17:31,700 --> 00:17:33,260
you'd like to provide for me?

300
00:17:36,220 --> 00:17:37,020
I came here today

301
00:17:37,020 --> 00:17:38,980
because of Lv Mengde's death.

302
00:17:42,660 --> 00:17:43,460
I understand.

303
00:17:44,300 --> 00:17:45,660
I killed him.

304
00:17:46,700 --> 00:17:48,780
And I was the one
who reported Ding Zhao.

305
00:17:52,020 --> 00:17:53,980
You already found
the fragrant grass, didn't you?

306
00:17:54,700 --> 00:17:56,300
Why are you looking at me like that?

307
00:17:56,580 --> 00:17:57,980
Why did you kill him?

308
00:17:58,980 --> 00:18:00,740
And why did you frame Ding Zhao?

309
00:18:02,020 --> 00:18:02,860
Of course, it was

310
00:18:02,860 --> 00:18:05,340
to make the most of this
opportunity Heaven gave me.

311
00:18:07,700 --> 00:18:08,540
Dr. Bai.

312
00:18:10,180 --> 00:18:11,340
I've been waiting for this day

313
00:18:12,820 --> 00:18:14,620
for ten whole years.

314
00:18:16,580 --> 00:18:19,340
♪And watch the lights
come on one by one♪

315
00:18:19,980 --> 00:18:22,980
♪Like blades cutting
through the radiance♪

316
00:18:23,620 --> 00:18:26,380
♪You may treat me as dust
beneath your feet♪

317
00:18:26,380 --> 00:18:28,340
♪Or wipe me away like ashes♪

318
00:18:28,340 --> 00:18:29,900
♪Leaving a cold ending♪

319
00:18:29,900 --> 00:18:31,860
♪But I refuse to fall♪

320
00:18:31,860 --> 00:18:36,900
♪I refuse to become a shadow
fading beneath the lights♪

321
00:18:36,900 --> 00:18:39,380
♪I refuse to dissolve into♪

322
00:18:40,420 --> 00:18:43,380
♪The lifeless light of the past♪

323
00:18:43,780 --> 00:18:46,660
♪I want sharpness at my fingertips♪

324
00:18:46,660 --> 00:18:49,580
♪And steps that avoid
the traps among the thorns♪

325
00:18:50,140 --> 00:18:53,020
♪At dawn, I will look
straight into your eyes♪

326
00:18:53,020 --> 00:18:56,420
♪My gaze clear, illuminating the dawn♪

327
00:18:57,700 --> 00:19:00,340
♪Those who have hurt me♪

328
00:19:00,980 --> 00:19:03,660
♪I choose to pierce through♪

329
00:19:05,340 --> 00:19:06,820
♪To tear apart♪

330
00:19:06,940 --> 00:19:12,900
♪To ignite a sacred flame♪

331
00:19:14,460 --> 00:19:16,460
♪I do not pray to the gods♪

332
00:19:16,460 --> 00:19:19,460
♪Nor bow to power♪

333
00:19:19,460 --> 00:19:21,900
♪I will no longer play the tragic lead♪

334
00:19:23,660 --> 00:19:27,340
♪I will stand and carve
the path of my own fate♪
